{"id": "2814204", "name": "מד\"ר סדר שני עם נגזרות מדויקות", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<p></p><p></p><p>נתונה המשוואה הדיפרנציאלית הבאה</p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">\\[ {{CT:0}}\\]</p>&nbsp;מצאו פתרון למד\"ר המקיים את תנאי ההתחלה:<br><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"rtl\"></p><p></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\">\\(y({{CT:1}})={{CT:2}}, \\quad y'({{CT:1}})={{CT:3}}\\)</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\" dir=\"ltr\">\\(y(x)= \\)[[input:ans1]] [[validation:ans1]]</p><p style=\"text-align: right;\" dir=\"rtl\">הדרכה: מצאו פונקציות \\(f,g\\) כך שאגף שמאל של המשוואה הוא נגזרת של הביטוי \\(f(x)y'+g(x)y\\).&nbsp;</p>", "generalfeedback": "", "specificfeedback": "[[feedback:prt1]]", "prtcorrect": "Correct answer, well done.", "prtpartiallycorrect": "Your answer is partially correct.", "prtincorrect": "Incorrect answer.", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 40, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": ""}], "prts": [{"name": "prt1", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "sa1:subst(y=ans1,ode);\nsa2:ev(sa1,nouns);\nsa3:trigsimp(fullratsimp(expand(radcan(sa2))));\nsatisfiedODE:is(sa3);\ninitalCondition:is(equal(trigsimp(fullratsimp(radcan(ev(ans1,x=x0)))),trigsimp(fullratsimp(radcan(y0))))) and is(equal(trigsimp(fullratsimp(radcan(subst(x=x0,diff(ans1,x))))),trigsimp(fullratsimp(radcan(y1)))));", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "satisfiedODE", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הפונקציה שכתבתם אכן פותרת את המשוואה.<br></p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "prt1-1-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הפונקציה שקיבלתם לא פותרת את המשוואה.<br></p>"}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "true", "tans": "initalCondition", "testoptions": null, "quiet": true, "on_true": {"scoremode": "+", "score": 0.5, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-T", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הפונקציה עונה על תנאי ההתחלה.<br></p>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "-", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "prt1-2-F", "feedback": "<p dir=\"rtl\" style=\"text-align: right;\">הפונקציה אינה עונה על תנאי ההתחלה.<br></p>"}}]}], "qvnames": ["a0", "a1", "a2", "b0", "b1", "k", "ode", "r", "x0", "y0", "y1", "yp"], "nvariants": 50}